Z||000001||TWEETIE BIRD||03-11-2001||08:15 PM||||You can check out this site:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.ohiocarclubs.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ohiocarclubs.com/</A> <P>Or, we (C.O.F.E) ( Central Ohio Fiero Enthusiasts) are having a car show June 23rd.<BR>Check our site for details:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.ohiofiero.com/default.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ohiofiero.com/default.htm</A> <P>We are just finalizing all the details and they will be posted soon. You can also email me and I will send you the details. <P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.ascenture.net/users/bhhum/fiero1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
